(reentry-transition-trace)
*sixdof
*method rk4-fixed variable-mass
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84
*file reentry_transition_trace.dat time alt vel range gamgd psigd wt

*trajectory 1 transition_vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecic x=20925646 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=300 zdt=0 time=0 mass=100
  *print time alt vel p q r yawgd pitchgd rollgd wt
  *segment 1 attitude-controlled
    *mass xcg=0 ixx=8 iyy=9 izz=10
    *aero caxial=0.2 cnormal=0.1 cm=0.02 cmq=-0.01
    *when time>1 goto 2
  *segment 2 point-mass-handoff
    *ptmass
    *aero caxial=0.08
    *when alt<0 stop
*end
